{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/hodaah_tail","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n310.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/hodaah/veal_kullam"}}
{"text":"For all of them may Thy Name, O our King, be continually blessed and exalted for ever and ever."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/hodaah/ukhetov"}}
{"text":"And inscribe for a good life all the children of Thy Covenant."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/text/vekhol_hachayyim"}}
{"text":"And all the living thank Thee, Selah, and praise Thy Name in truth, O God of our salvation and of our aid, Selah! Blessed art Thou, O Lord, All-benevolent, whose name is goodness and unto whom it is becoming to give thanks."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
